    "description": "Set on palm-fringed grounds along a private Pacific Ocean beach, this posh resort in a gated community is 9 minutes' walk from Litibú Golf Course and 42 km from Licenciado Gustavo Díaz Ordaz International Airport.\nAccommodations range from polished rooms with Wi-Fi, flat-screens and furnished terraces to suites featuring living rooms and private plunge pools. Some quarters offer ocean views. Room service is available.\nAmenities include 7 restaurants, a coffee shop and poolside bars, plus a spa, a traditional steam room and outdoor pools. There are tennis and basketball courts, in addition to a gym, breakfast and parking."
